    "Reason : 1 - On 29 July 2025, the proposed internal the proposed internal alterations to form an internal link between Unit 3 and Unit 4 and use a day nursery (Use Class E(f)) was not lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because: \r\nThe amalgamation of the units is restricted by Condition 54 of planning permission reference 00443/G/P7 (P/2000/0491). Planning permission is therefore required.\r\n"
